    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runaway Mole is a 2D platformer in which you play as a mole, and your goal is to get to the garden above you. To get there, you'll have to navigate underground tunnels full of hazards including pesticide pools, stalagmites, and stalactites, as well as bouncy mushrooms and tasty bugs. There are 10 levels, and you must beat all 10 in a row to reach the garden.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runaway Mole is a 2D platformer in which you play as a mole, and your goal is to get to the garden above you. To get there, you'll have to navigate underground tunnels full of hazards including pesticide pools, stalagmites, and stalactites, as well as bouncy mushrooms and tasty bugs. There are 10 levels, and you must beat all 10 in a row to reach the garden.</p>",
    "short_description": "A simple platformer in which you navigate underground tunnels as a mole to reach the garden above. Along the way you'll have to dodge pesticide pools, stalagmites, and stalactites. Jump on bouncy mushrooms to help you reach new heights, and eat some bugs, just for fun.",
